 'automation-is-not-integration':{title:'Better tools. Still disconnected?',html:`${title(`Better tools.<br>${mark('Still disconnected?')}`)}<div class="automation-bridge"><div class="automation-tasks"><span>AI drafts the risk</span><span>AI proposes a score</span><span>AI suggests a response</span><span>AI watches the signals</span></div><div class="connection-gap"><span>THE REAL TEST</span>${icon('target')}<h2>Does the next decision<br>protect the objective?</h2></div></div><p class="anchor">Automating tasks is useful. Connecting decisions is the bigger opportunity.</p>`},
