 'same-event-different-exposure':{title:'Who is exposed?',kind:'exposure revealed',html:`${title(`Who is ${mark('exposed?')}`)}${orgs(true)}<p class="micro">Relevance is not severity. <span>Verify the dependency before changing a score.</span></p>`},
